<title>CHINA: Shun Cheong, Tung Fong Hung shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Shun Cheong, Tung Fong Hung shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Shun Cheong Holdings Ltd and Tung Fong Hung (Holdings) Ltd was suspended on Tuesday at the companies' request pending announcements, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.</p>
<p>Shares of Shun Cheong, an electrical and mechanical engineering concern, rose HK$0.12 to HK$0.95 on Monday.</p>
<p>Shares of Tung Fong Hung, a retailer of Chinese medicines and health foods, added HK$0.07 to HK$0.445.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
